(Undergraduate Admissions Policy) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(Application Deadlines) Tj T*
(Applications for September entry open on 1 September of the previous year. The deadline for) Tj T*
(applications to Medicine and Law is 15 October. The deadline for all other undergraduate) Tj T*
(programmes is 31 January. Late applications are considered only if places remain.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(Entry Requirements) Tj T*
(The standard offer for Engineering is AAA at A-level including Mathematics and Physics. The) Tj T*
(standard offer for Business Management is ABB. The International Baccalaureate equivalent) Tj T*
(for Engineering is 36 points with 6 in Higher Level Mathematics.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(Interviews) Tj T*
(Applicants to Medicine are invited to a multiple mini interview held in December. Other) Tj T*
(programmes do not normally interview.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(Offers and Decisions) Tj T*
(Decisions on applications received by 31 January are made by 31 March. Applicants must reply) Tj T*
(to offers by 1 June.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(Deferred Entry) Tj T*
(Deferred entry for one year is accepted for most programmes, except Medicine.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
